@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama CD 1: GET /api/v1/sap/distributors (Consulta de Centros SAP Disponibles)

actor "Planificador" as User
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "SAP Connector" as SAP
participant "distributors DB" as DistDB

User -> Web: Clic en "+ Nuevo Centro de Distribución"
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/sap/distributors?cityId=1
Gateway -> Service: getAvailableSapDistributors(cityId)

Service -> SAP: fetchPlantsByCity(cityId)
SAP --> Service: sapPlants[] (codeSap, name, plantType, capacityPlts, lat, lng)

Service -> DistDB: findActiveDistributorsByCity(cityId)
DistDB --> Service: registeredDistributors[]

Service -> Service: matchAndEnrichStatus(sapPlants, registeredDistributors)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Cruza plantas SAP con registros locales
  - Marca 'isRegistered' (Disponible vs Registrado)
  - Limita a máx 5 centros por ciudad
end note

Service -> Service: buildSapDistributorsResponse()
Service --> Gateway: sapDistributorsResponse
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Catálogo SAP estructurado)
Web --> User: Renderiza tabla modal con centros disponibles
@enduml
